This distribution includes adapted Apache-2.0 source from these forks:

- alexzhues/discord-mcp, commit 3b1f882eebd1a49632b6941d4c68130332cc3d51:
  opt-in DM/mention Events protocol, callback verification, durable worker,
  event-bound context/replies, and associated tests.
- argos-repos/discord-mcp, commit fcd3382330f31f37251a703c3d2af6dd1697b8a8:
  invite/reaction input validation and REST-boundary regression tests.
- thesammykins/discord-mcp-typescript, commit 5dce0692def01e795ac29ea76a937f9838986827:
  archive/message pagination contracts, reply identity projection, and tests.
- The1Studio/discord-mcp, commits 760be1f3f313784cc0b5a03acbff58c137011df4
  and 7914251ea000d1686d5ef9ff1ea9fe2c7317b3f1:
  known-permission evidence handling and tool-description compaction.

Integration and additional storage, scope, and description safeguards were
developed with AI assistance. Upstream descriptions retain all semantic
sections, including Returns; personal deployment configuration is not included.

Runtime libraries added for Events: ipaddr.js and standardwebhooks (MIT),
and discord.js (Apache-2.0). Their own license notices accompany those packages.
